00:16:46.320 --> 00:16:50.420
which allows you to store
document based data.

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:52.212
And the advantage
of that is actually

00:16:52.212 --> 00:16:53.670
that it's very
flexible in a sense.

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:57.090
